      "standardized_narrative": "The syndicate reported a prior accident year release of GBP 11.5 million, primarily from long-tail lines, reflecting favorable emerging experience as the business matures. This release occurred despite higher-than-planned catastrophe activity in 2018, including losses from Hurricane Michael, Typhoon Jebi, Camp fire, Hurricane Florence, and Typhoon Trami. The net loss ratio improved significantly, partly due to the absence of major 2017 catastrophe impacts like Hurricanes Harvey, Irma, and Maria in the current year's results.",
